cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MalaForge or MalaCall, please cite it as below."
title: "MalaForge & MalaCall: a low-cost pan-Plasmodium amplicon assay and analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  MalaForge is an amplicon-panel design toolkit and MalaCall an end-to-end analysis and reporting
  pipeline for a single low-cost sequencing assay covering all human malaria parasites
  (Plasmodium falciparum, P. vivax, P. ovale curtisi, P. ovale wallikeri, P. malariae, P. knowlesi).
  It provides species identification, per-species drug-resistance genotyping, pfhrp2/3 deletion and
  gene-amplification detection, parasite diversity and complexity-of-infection, P. knowlesi
  subpopulation typing, and cohort-level relatedness on Oxford Nanopore, Illumina and MGI platforms.
